{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"20":"Tribute, Spoils, and Rulership (Kitab Al-Kharaj, Wal-Fai' Wal-Imarah)"},"section_detail":{"20":{"hadithnumber_first":2928,"hadithnumber_last":3088,"arabicnumber_first":2928,"arabicnumber_last":3088,"name_native":"كتاب الخراج، والفياء والعمارة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2938,"arabicnumber":2938,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن عبد الله القطان، عن ابن مغراء، عن ابن اسحاق، قال الذي يعشر الناس يعني صاحب المكس","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Maqtu"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Maqtu"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":20,"hadith":11}}]}